{"sections":[{"slug":"链同伦等价","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"链同伦等价"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">链同伦等价</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"链同伦等价"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">链同伦等价是一对链映射</span> $f,g$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $fg$, $gf$ <span lang=\"zh\">同伦于恒等态射</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">链同伦等价是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟同构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟同构</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">但反之不然</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span> $\\mathsf {Ab}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的链复形</span> $\\mathbb{Z}\\overset{\\times 2}{\\to}\\mathbb{Z}$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathbb{Z}/2$ <span lang=\"zh\">有一个拟同构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而两者之间不存在链同伦等价</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}